#: inc/customizer/callbacks/about-country.php:499
msgid "Northern Himalayan People"
msgstr "Les peuples de l'Himalaya septentrional"

#: inc/customizer/callbacks/about-country.php:655
msgid ""
"Northward, on the lower slopes and spurs of the great Himalayas, oaks and "
"pines are the dominant species up to an altitude of about 2400m above which "
"are found dense conifer forests including Picea, Tusga, Larix and Abies spp. "
"The latter is usually confined to higher elevations with Betula typically "
"marking the upper limit of the tree line. At about 3600 to 3900m, "
"rhododendron, bamboo and maples are commonly associated with the coniferous "
"zone. Composition of he forest varies considerably with coniferous "
"predominating in the west and eracaceous in the east. The wildlife of this "
"region includes the Himalayan bear, serow, ghoral, barking deer and wildboar,"
" with Himalayan tahr sometimes being seen on steep rocky faces above 2400m. "
"The red panda is among the more interesting of the mammals found in this "
"zone; it appears to be fairly distributed in suitable areas of the forest "
"above 1800m. The rich and varied avifauna of this region includes several "
"spectacular and beautiful pheasants, including the Danfe pheasant, "
"Nepal&rsquo;s national bird."
msgstr ""
"Plus au nord, sur les contreforts et éperons du grand Himalaya, chênes et "
"pins dominent jusqu'à environ 2 400 m d'altitude, au-delà de laquelle on "
"trouve de denses forêts de conifères comprenant Picea, Tsuga, Larix et Abies "
"spp. Ce dernier genre se limite généralement aux altitudes plus élevées, le "
"bouleau marquant typiquement la limite supérieure de la forêt. Vers 3 600 à "
"3 900 m, rhododendrons, bambous et érables sont fréquemment associés à la "
"zone de conifères. La composition de la forêt varie considérablement, les "
"conifères dominant à l'ouest et les feuillus à l'est. La faune de cette "
"région comprend l'ours de l'Himalaya, le serow, le ghoral, le muntjac et le "
"sanglier, le tahr de l'Himalaya étant parfois observé sur les parois "
"rocheuses abruptes au-dessus de 2 400 m. Le panda roux est l'un des "
"mammifères les plus intéressants de cette zone ; il semble assez bien "
"réparti dans les zones forestières adaptées au-dessus de 1 800 m. L'avifaune "
"riche et variée de cette région comprend plusieurs faisans spectaculaires, "
"dont le faisan Danfe, oiseau national du Népal."

